From 63dfb8d006b734f27ae3c031bc881c170aee3a55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:59:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): expire external render evidence on explicit
 clocks [daveey]

A mounted row retained the same task object while the React Compiler cached
implicit Date.now defaults. Thread the observation clock into stripe and dot
hover calculations; use a plugin-local ticking clock for badge and meter so
the plugin stays within its SDK boundary. Describe missed checks as overdue
and correct four Traditional Chinese labels.

Regression proof on 6c73d732: mounted stripe, dot, badge and actual registered
statusbar meter each fail before their clock fix. Unknown/past-due hover
cases at 1420 and 1901 fail before the wording fix. All pass after in the
ui vitest project with React Compiler enabled.
